    role: "VP People & Culture",
    org: "TCS",
    type: "Corporate",
    quote: "Our inter-hub trivia championship with live buzzers had a 94% live participation rate across 8 cities. Outstanding work!",
    stars: 5,
    accent: "#FDB913",
    bg: "#FFF8E1",
    initials: "VK"
  },
  {
    author: "Ananya S.",
    role: "Grade 8 Student",
    org: "Inventure Academy",
    type: "Student",
    quote: "I used to find social studies boring until QShala showed us real stories behind current events. QT mascot is my favorite!",
    stars: 5,
    accent: "#30B2E7",
    bg: "#E8F6FD",
    initials: "AS"
  },
  {
    author: "Kavitha Rao",
    role: "Head of Middle School",
    org: "Greenwood High",
    type: "School",
